   "text": "University of Auckland (Foundation) - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nUniversity of Auckland (Foundation)\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nThe University of Auckland (UoA) is a public research university based in Auckland, New Zealand. It is the largest, most comprehensive, and highest-ranked university in New Zealand and consistently places among the top 100 universities in the QS World University Rankings. The institution was established in 1883 as a constituent college of the University of New Zealand. Originally it was housed in a disused courthouse. Today, the University of Auckland is New Zealand's largest university by enrolment, hosting about 40,000 students on five Auckland campuses. The City Campus, in the Auckland CBD, has the bulk of the students and faculties. There are eight faculties, including a law school, as well as three associated research institutes.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n27/03/2026 06:39\nby Gunia Beniwal\nCreated\n27/03/2026 06:39\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nPathway\nCountry\nNew Zealand\nYearly Fees\nMax: NZ$31,000.00\nMin: NZ$15,000.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n20%\n8,000 of 40,000 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nUP Education\nFounded Year\n1883\nCampus(es)\nAuckland\nCountry\nNew Zealand\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n01/02/2025\nContract End Date\n31/01/2027\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nhttps://www.auckland.ac.nz/en/on-campus/accommodation.html\nScholarship Offered\nhttps://www.auckland.ac.nz/en/study/scholarships-and-awards.html\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Di0mvQAX8dE\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-"